.Sh CAVEATS
The facilities above do not establish qualification of a physical image,
NIC, display, keyboard or writable device. Consult the exact-image evidence;
serial QEMU operation does not establish physical console usability.
The seed in
.Pa /ssh
is an ordinary file to anyone with the image.
Building needs the platform and kernel sources and their pinned
toolchains; there is no prebuilt release.
